##### FungaRoot  
*solo / duo* 

Split cassette couples root crops with truffle mycorrhiza. Precision pH and moisture coax simultaneous vegetables and mini truffles.

###### Crop Categories & Cultivars  
Roots & stems – Finger Carrot, Baby Beet, Tokyo Turnip, Baby Kohlrabi  
Mushrooms & fungi – Truffle-Inoculated Herb Pod  

